# Line endings (review I-08): every text file is stored and checked out with LF, so that a clone on
# Windows does not show the whole tree as modified. Windows scripts keep CRLF; binaries are left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.jar binary
*.apk binary
*.p12 binary
*.keystore binary
